{"repositoryId":1158370094,"availability":"available","full":"yashraj10/churn-prediction-model","name":"churn-prediction-model","description":"Churn prediction system detecting behavioral disengagement via drift-based features (0.92 AUC) with IPW-adjusted uplift analysis. Includes Streamlit dashboard.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-15T08:51:02Z","updated":"2026-02-20T00:18:16Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://churn-prediction-model-y.streamlit.app/","topics":["causal-inference","churn-prediction","data-science","feature-engineering","machine-learning","python","streamlit","xgboost"],"demo":"https://churn-prediction-model-y.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:35.522Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:35.522Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:35.522Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T00:54:35.522Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Predicting Churn Timing and Measuring Notification Impact for Long-Tenured Wellness Users","This project builds a two-model system for a wellness/fitness subscription app:","The analysis focuses on long-tenured users (180+ day tenure), verified with an explicit assertion in code."],"features":["Churn Prediction Model — An XGBoost classifier that detects behavioral drift (declining session frequency, shrinking workout durations, growing inactivity gaps) to identify users likely to cancel within 30 days.","Uplift Analysis — Estimates the association between push notifications and churn reduction using Inverse Propensity Weighting (IPW) to adjust for confounding, with time-window enforcement on notification timing.","Notifications are associated with lower churn (13.9% → 11.4%), adjusted via IPW. This is an observational estimate — a randomized A/B test would be needed to confirm causality."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yashraj10/churn-prediction-model/blob/main/README.